  "construction": {
    "basis": "reconstruction",
    "fidelity": "not-applicable",
    "note": "The finished design was read from Wichmann’s L90 drawing, its bevelled bands reduced to their centre lines and snapped to the square-root-of-two grid. It shares every construction line but one with the Seville octagon rings: the circle, the octagon round it and the lines at height V, then lines through crossings of earlier lines, turned round O. The drawing gives no steps; we devised the construction.",
    "changes": "The compass steps, their order and the named points are ours. The plaster bands are drawn as their centre lines; the pieces are the window’s openings, in one colour, and the small kites and triangles where the bands cross, which are solid plaster. No photograph was checked.",
    "reviewed": "2026-10-26"
  },
  "credits": [
    {
      "source": "Tiling Search, data181/L90: Dar Si Said museum, Marrakesh",
      "creator": "Brian Wichmann",
      "kind": "drawing",
      "url": "https://tilingsearch.mit.edu/HTML/data181/L90.html",
      "note": "Read from his finished drawing, not construction instructions. His reference is Rom Landau and Wim Swaan, Morocco: Marrakesh, Fez, Rabat (1967), figure 90, page 142: a pierced plaster window, without colour, in the Museum of Dar Si Said, Marrakesh."
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Draw a horizontal straight line through O and A. Draw a circle with centre O through A.",
      "create": {"c": {"circle": {"centre": "O", "through": "A"}}, "h": {"line": {"through": ["O", "A"]}}},
      "animate": "compass",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Draw a circle with centre O through A."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Draw a vertical line through O. Draw a vertical line through A. Turn it round O by 45°, seven times. The eight lines touch the circle. They make an octagon round it.",
      "create": {
        "v": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "ax": {"line": {"through": "A", "perpendicularTo": "h"}},
        "axr": {"repeat": {"of": ["ax"], "by": "rot8"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "Draw a vertical line through A. Turn it round O by 45°, seven times. The eight lines touch the circle. They make an octagon round it."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The vertical line through A, turned by 90°, crosses the vertical line through A at E. Draw a straight line through O and E. Draw a line through O at 90° to line OE.",
      "create": {
        "E": {"point": {"meet": ["ax", "ax@2"]}},
        "d45": {"line": {"through": ["O", "E"]}},
        "d135": {"line": {"through": "O", "perpendicularTo": "d45"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The vertical line through A, turned by 45°, crosses the vertical line through A at V. Draw a horizontal line through V. Turn it round O by 45°, seven times.",
      "create": {
        "V": {"point": {"meet": ["ax", "ax@1"]}},
        "vt": {"line": {"through": "V", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "vtr": {"repeat": {"of": ["vt"], "by": "rot8"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "The vertical line through A, turned by 45°, crosses the vertical line through A at V. Draw a horizontal line through V. Turn it round O by 45°, 225° and 315°."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The horizontal line through V, turned by 315°, crosses the horizontal line through V at P1. Draw a vertical line through P1. Turn it round O by 45°, seven times.",
      "create": {
        "P1": {"point": {"meet": ["vt@7", "vt"]}},
        "m1": {"line": {"through": "P1", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "mr1": {"repeat": {"of": ["m1"], "by": "rot8"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The horizontal line through V crosses the vertical line through P1, turned by 315°, at P2. The vertical line through A crosses the vertical line through P1, turned by 135°, at P3. Draw a vertical line through P2. Draw a horizontal line through P3. Turn the new lines round O by 45°, seven times.",
      "create": {
        "P2": {"point": {"meet": ["vt", "m1@7"]}},
        "P3": {"point": {"meet": ["ax", "m1@3"]}},
        "m2": {"line": {"through": "P2", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "m3": {"line": {"through": "P3", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "mr3": {"repeat": {"of": ["m2", "m3"], "by": "rot8"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "The horizontal line through V crosses the vertical line through P2, turned by 315°, at P4. Draw a vertical line through P4. Turn it round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "P4": {"point": {"meet": ["vt", "m2@7"]}},
        "m4": {"line": {"through": "P4", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "mr4": {"repeat": {"of": ["m4"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "The vertical line through A crosses the horizontal line through V, turned by 45°, at P5. The vertical line through A, turned by 315°, crosses the horizontal line through V at P6. Draw a horizontal line through P5. Draw a vertical line through P6. Turn the new lines round O by 45°, seven times.",
      "create": {
        "P5": {"point": {"meet": ["ax", "vt@1"]}},
        "P6": {"point": {"meet": ["ax@7", "vt"]}},
        "m5": {"line": {"through": "P5", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "m6": {"line": {"through": "P6", "parallelTo": "v"}},
        "mr6": {"repeat": {"of": ["m5", "m6"], "by": "rot8"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "The horizontal line through P3 crosses the vertical line through P6 at P7. The horizontal line through V, turned by 225°, crosses the horizontal line through P5 at P8. Draw a line through E at 90° to line OE. Draw a line through P7 at 90° to line OE. Draw a line through P8 at 90° to line OE. Turn the new lines round O by 90°, three times.",
      "create": {
        "P7": {"point": {"meet": ["m3", "m6"]}},
        "P8": {"point": {"meet": ["vt@5", "m5"]}},
        "m7": {"line": {"through": "E", "parallelTo": "d135"}},
        "m8": {"line": {"through": "P7", "parallelTo": "d135"}},
        "m9": {"line": {"through": "P8", "parallelTo": "d135"}},
        "mr9": {"repeat": {"of": ["m7", "m8", "m9"], "by": "rot4"}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "The line through E at 90° to line OE crosses the vertical line through O at T. Draw a horizontal line through T. Turn it round O by 90°, three times. The four lines make a square with corners K1, K2, K3 and K4.",
      "create": {
        "T": {"point": {"meet": ["m7", "v"]}},
        "gy": {"line": {"through": "T", "parallelTo": "h"}},
        "gyr": {"repeat": {"of": ["gy"], "by": "rot4"}},
        "K1": {"point": {"meet": ["gy@3", "gy"]}},
        "K2": {"point": {"meet": ["gy", "gy@1"]}},
        "K3": {"point": {"meet": ["gy@1", "gy@2"]}},
        "K4": {"point": {"meet": ["gy@2", "gy@3"]}}
      },
      "animate": "ruler",
      "textWithoutHelpers": "The line through E at 90° to line OE crosses the vertical line through O at T. Draw a horizontal line through T. Turn it round O by 90° each way. The three lines are sides of the square with corners K1, K2, K3 and K4."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "Join K1, K2, K3 and K4 to mark the tile that repeats.",
      "create": {"tile": {"polygon": ["K1", "K2", "K3", "K4"]}},
      "animate": "fade"
    }
  ],
